<p class="wp-block-paragraph"> <strong>Difficulty:</strong> </p>



<div class="wp-block-small-plugins-category-labels category-labels-block-root has-link-color wp-elements-7 is-layout-flex wp-container-small-plugins-category-labels-is-layout-9a33bd5c wp-block-small-plugins-category-labels-is-layout-flex">


<a class="wp-block-small-plugins-post-term category-label-link_root is-layout-flex wp-block-small-plugins-post-term-is-layout-flex" href="https://www.theflavorbender.com/category/skill-level/intermediate-recipes/" rel="noopener" target="_self">
