	<ol style="margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)" class="wp-block-comment-template"><li id="comment-198097" class="comment even thread-even depth-1">
	
	<div class="wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-e02479de wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="margin-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)">
		<div class="wp-block-comment-author-name">Cheryl H.</div>

		
		<div class="wp-block-group has-custom-contrast-light-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-small-font-size wp-elements-9 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8032b07a wp-block-group-is-layout-flex" style="font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; line-height: 1.2; text-transform: uppercase">
			<div class="wp-block-comment-date"><time datetime="2026-08-14T11:16:06-04:00"><a href="https://www.theflavorbender.com/easy-homemade-chicken-ramen/comment-page-9/#comment-198097">August 14, 2026</a></time></div>

			
		</div>
		

		<div class="wp-block-comment-content"><p><img decoding="async" class="wprm-comment-rating perfmatters-lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='80'%20height='16'%20viewBox='0%200%2080%2016'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="5 stars" width="80" height="16" data-src="https://www.theflavorbender.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-recipe-maker/assets/icons/rating/stars-alt-5.svg" /><br />
I wanted some ramen but didn&#8217;t have all the ingredients, so I improvised and basically followed only the chicken part of the recipe, using the seasoning from the ramen noodle packets I had. The chicken on its own was delicious, so now I really want to try this with ALL the correct ingredients! </p>
<p>I have some dashi powder that I&#8217;m kicking myself for not adding to the broth I had. Sounds like that might be a good addition for more flavor if needed. Thanks so much for sharing this!</p>
</div>

		<div class="wp-block-comment-reply-link"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-198097" data-commentid="198097" data-postid="25902" data-belowelement="comment-198097" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Cheryl H." aria-label="Reply to Cheryl H.">Reply</a></div>
	</div>
	
